      "text": "That prior to the present petition, the petitioner filed a civil suit for permanent and mandatory injunctions In Re: - Satish Chand Rastogi Versus Rawat Mal & Anr. vide suit No. 403/2013. In the said suit, when the present petitioner realized that he was on the verge of losing the case, the petitioner withdrew the said petition. The respondents admitted that Sh. Rawat Mal was inducted as a tenant in the suit premises and that Sh.",
